          "maxAge": 5,
          "media": {
            "duration": 3615,
            "fileSize": 58244354
          },
          "description": "Join Bluey on an audio odyssey collecting eight amazing stories based on the hit ABC KIDS TV show!  The Beach Join Bluey for a fun day at the beach. What will you discover along the way? While Mum is off for a walk along the beach, Bluey discovers a beautiful shell. She runs to show Mum and has a series of encounters that will both excite and test her in unexpected ways.  The Pool Bluey and Bingo head to the pool with Dad. What could go wrong?   Charades  At Nana’s house, Bluey and Bingo play a game of Charades. Can they help the littlies stick to the rules?  Daddy Robot Can Bluey and Bingo get Daddy Robot to tidy up the playroom?  Baby Race Meet baby Bluey as she learns to walk with her friends. Will Mum help her win the baby race?  Barky Boats Bluey and Mackenzie are excited to see their buddies, but will Mia and Captain still have time to play with them?  Typewriter Bluey's typewriter is missing. Will she and her friends find what they are looking for?  Magic Xylophone Bluey and Bingo are having lots of fun playing the Magic Xylophone game with Dad, but can they learn to share?  Bluey is a six-year-old blue heeler pup who loves to play. Along with her friends and family, Bluey enjoys exploring the world and using her imagination to turn everyday life into an amazing adventure. Bluey is an Australian children’s television program by the Emmy® award-winning Ludo Studio for ABC KIDS and is co-commissioned by ABC Children’s and BBC Studios.",
